items/fs-bounded-implies-convergent.md:67:[L6] Convergence, and the fact that a constant sequence converges to its value ([[def-real-limit]], [[def-sequence]]).
items/fs-bounded-implies-convergent.md:69:[L7] Divergence test: a sequence with two subsequences converging to different limits does not converge ([[lem-subsequence-inherits-limit]]).
items/fs-bounded-implies-convergent.md:71:[L8] Boundedness of a sequence ([[def-sequence]]).
