          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "The relation $\\le$ on $\\mathbb{N}$, where $m \\le n \\iff \\exists k\\ (m + k = n)$ ([[def-nat-order]]), is a linear (total) order: reflexive, antisymmetric, transitive, and total.",
